  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Drooping eyelids and double vision for six weeks, worse in the evening, with fatigable weakness of the arms and neck, tiring when chewing and a nasal voice after long talks; a disorder of the neuromuscular junction suspected</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
